"  PS: ¡No se lo cuentes a mi padre!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:786"
msgid ""
"This is a letter:\n"
" \"Double the amount of copper excavated from the\n"
"  mines. The gnomes will pay extra for anything above\n"
"  the standard amount.\""
msgstr ""
"La carta lee así:\n"
" \"Dobla la cantidad de cobre extraído de las \n"
"  minas. Los gnomos pagarán un extra por cualquier \n"
"  cantidad superior al cupo.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:790"
msgid ""
"This is a letter:\n"
"\n"
" \"Double, double toil and trouble;\n"
"  Fire burn, and cauldron bubble.\""
msgstr ""
"La carta lee así:\n"
"\n"
" \"Cobra, cobra, llanto espanto;\n"
"  Fuego ven, con humo y llanto.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:793"
msgid ""
"This is just an advertisement:\n"
"\n"
" \"%s's %s has\n"
"  the finest items in all the realm!\""
msgstr ""
"Esto es solo un anuncio:\n"
"\n"
" \"%s's %s tiene\n"
"  ¡Los mejores artículos de todo el reino!\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:796"
msgid ""
"This is an old scrawled note:\n"
"\n"
" \"I lie here in the dark now,\n"
"  waiting for death.\""
msgstr ""
"Esta es una vieja nota garabateada:\n"
"\n"
" \"Heme aquí en las tinieblas,\n"
"  esperando la muerte.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:799"
msgid ""
"This is an old scrawled note:\n"
"\n"
" \"The Dopefish lives!\""
msgstr ""
"Esta es una vieja nota garabateada:\n"
"\n"
" \"¡El Dopefish vive!\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:801"
msgid ""
"This is an old scrawled note:\n"
" \"Mee wurst troll evurr\n"
"  nobuddy pay brijj tole"
msgstr ""
"Esta es una vieja nota garabateada:\n"
" \"Io e peor troll de itoria\n"
"  nadie paga peage puente"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:802"
msgid ""
"  me nott sceary enuf\n"
"  mee gett drunc an kil sellf\n"
"  troll droun\""
msgstr ""
"  Io no dar miedo\n"
"  Me boi aborracha y matar\n"
"  troll aogar\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:807"
msgid ""
"This is a letter:\n"
" \"Our exploration of the Devil's Bastion has\n"
"  failed after an extended encounter with the\n"
"  dungeon's inhabitants.\""
msgstr ""
"La carta lee así:\n"
" \"Nuestra exploración del Bastión de Diablo\n"
"  ha fracasado tras un desafortunado encuentro con\n"
"  sus habitantes.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:811"
msgid ""
"This is a hand-written note:\n"
" \"Ten paces northeast from the mizzenmast;"
msgstr ""
"Una nota escrita a mano:\n"
" \"Diez pasos al nordeste desde el palo mayor;"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:812"
msgid ""
"  27 steps down to the hold;\n"
"  And five paces to the right;\n"
"  And dig at spot marked 'X'\""
msgstr ""
"  27 pasos hacia la bodega;\n"
"  Cinco pasos a la derecha;\n"
"  y cava donde marca la 'X'\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:816"
msgid ""
"This is a letter:\n"
"\n"
" \"A horse, a horse! My kingdom for a horse!\""
msgstr ""
"La carta lee así:\n"
"\n"
" \"¡Un caballo, un caballo! ¡Mi reino por un caballo!\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:817"
msgid ""
"This is a hand-written note:\n"
"\n"
" \"Alright everybody, let's mosey!\""
msgstr ""
"Una nota escrita a mano:\n"
"\n"
" \"Muy bien, ¡allevoy!\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:818"
msgid ""
"This is a letter:\n"
" \"It is tradition to speak with the royal 'we',\n"
"  and to use THIS MUCH VOLUME WHEN ADDRESSING OUR\n"
"  SUBJECTS!!!\""
msgstr ""
"La carta lee así:\n"
" \"Es tradición hablar con el 'vos' nobiliario,\n"
"  y ¡DE USAR ESTE VOLUMEN CUANDO TRATAMOS LOS\n"
"  TEMAS!\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:822"
msgid ""
"This is a letter:\n"
"\n"
" \"swim swim hungry\""
msgstr ""
"La carta lee así:\n"
"\n"
" \"Nada, nada, bocadito\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:824"
msgid ""
"This is a hand-written note:\n"
"\n"
" \"There's daggers in men's smiles.\""
msgstr ""
"Una nota escrita a mano:\n"
"\n"
" \"Su sonrisa me inspira la misma confianza que una daga en el cuello.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:826"
msgid ""
"This is a hand-written note:\n"
"\n"
" \"It's a secret to everybody.\""
msgstr ""
"Una nota escrita a mano:\n"
"\n"
" \"Es un secreto para todos.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:828"
msgid ""
"This is a hand-written note:\n"
"\n"
" \"BEHIND YOU!\""
msgstr ""
"Una nota escrita a mano: \n"
"\n"
" \"¡Detrás de ti!\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:830"
msgid ""
"This is a letter:\n"
" \"Of all the words of mice and men,\n"
"  The saddest are,\n"
"  'It might have been.'\""
msgstr ""
"La carta lee así:\n"
" \"Si acaso doblares la vara de la justicia,\n"
"  no sea con el peso de la dádiva,\n"
"  sino con el de la misericordia.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:834"
msgid ""
"This is a blood-stained note:\n"
"\n"
" \"Yes, Avatar, seek a way home!\""
msgstr ""
"Una nota manchada de sangre:\n"
"\n"
" \"Eso, Avatar, ¡busca un camino a casa!\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:836"
msgid ""
"This letter is covered in crumbs:\n"
"\n"
" \"Boil 'em, mash 'em, stick 'em in a stew!\""
msgstr ""
"Una nota cubierta de migajas:\n"
"\n"
" \"En puré, cocidas, o ¡en un buen guiso!\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:838"
msgid ""
"This is a hand-written note:\n"
"\n"
" \"They say life is wasted on the living.\""
msgstr ""
"Una nota escrita a mano:\n"
"\n"
" \"Malgastamos la vida con los vivos.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:840"
msgid ""
"This is a scrawled note:\n"
"\n"
" \"These donuts are great! Jelly-filled are my\n"
"  favorite! Nothing beats a jelly-filled donut.\""
msgstr ""
"Una nota apresurada:\n"
"\n"
" \"¡Estas rosquillas son geniales! ¡Los rellenos de mermelada son mis\n"
"  favoritos! Nada mejor que esos.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:843"
msgid ""
"This is a scrawled note:\n"
"\n"
" \"Hey, I know! I'll use my trusty frying\n"
"  pan... as a drying pan!\""
msgstr ""
"Una nota apresurada:\n"
"\n"
" \"Fue sin querer\n"
" queriendo\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:846"
msgid ""
"This is a letter:\n"
"\n"
" \"Please disregard the previous letter.\""
msgstr ""
"La carta lee así:\n"
"\n"
" \"Por favor, ignora la carta anterior.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:848"
msgid "As you read the scroll, it disappears."
msgstr "A medida que lees el pergamino, desaparece."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:849"
msgid "This is a scroll of identify!"
msgstr "¡Este es un pergamino de identificar!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:850"
msgid "But you have no unidentified items..."
msgstr "Pero no tienes objetos que identificar..."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:851"
msgid "A field of light surrounds you!"
msgstr "¡Un área de luz te envuelve!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:852"
msgid "This scroll is blank."
msgstr "Este pergamino está en blanco."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:853"
msgid "Your hand feels warm for a moment."
msgstr "Notas calidez en tu mano por un instante."

#. Versiones: 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:854"
msgid "Your weapon glows ominously."
msgstr "Tu arma brilla con una luz negra."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:855"
msgid "Your weapon glows blue."
msgstr "Tu arma brilla con una luz azul."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:856"
msgid "Your weapon violently glows blue."
msgstr "Tu arma brilla con una violenta luz azul."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:857"
msgid "Your skin feels warm for a moment."
msgstr "Notas calidez en tu piel por un instante."

#. Versiones: 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:858"
msgid "Your %s glows ominously."
msgstr "Tu %s brilla con una luz negra."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:859"
msgid "Your %s glows blue."
msgstr "Tu %s brilla con una luz azul."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:860"
msgid "Your %s violently glows blue."
msgstr "Tu %s brilla con una violenta luz azul."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:861"
msgid "You feel like someone is helping you."
msgstr "Sientes como si alguien te ayudara."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:862"
msgid "You feel funny for a moment."
msgstr "Una sensación extraña recorre tu cuerpo por un instante."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:863"
msgid "The scroll smokes and crumbles to ash!"
msgstr "¡El pergamino echa humo y se convierte en polvo!"

#. Versiones: 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:864"
msgid "The scroll erupts in a circle of flame!"
msgstr "¡El pergamino estalla en un pilar de fuego!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:865"
msgid "A feast suddenly appears before you!"
msgstr "¡Un festín aparece súbitamente delante de ti!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:866"
msgid "Your stomach grumbles, but it passes."
msgstr "Tu estómago ruge, pero es pasajero."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:867"
msgid "Your food pouch feels lighter!"
msgstr "¡Tus bolsillos se sienten más ligeros!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:868"
msgid "A map coalesces in your mind!"
msgstr "¡Un mapa se dibuja en tu mente!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:869"
msgid "Huh? What? Where am I?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Qué? ¿Dónde estoy?"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:870"
msgid "You feel a tingling sensation, but it passes."
msgstr "Notas un cosquilleo, pero se te pasa."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:871"
msgid "Your %s vibrates."
msgstr "Tu %s vibra."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:872"
msgid "Your %s looks better!"
msgstr "¡Tu %s se ve mejor!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:873"
msgid "Your skin itches for a moment."
msgstr "Te pica la piel por un momento."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:874"
msgid "Your %s vibrates."
msgstr "Tus %s vibran."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:875"
msgid "Your %s suddenly breaks!"
msgstr "¡Tu %s se rompe repentinamente!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:876"
msgid "You feel disoriented for a moment."
msgstr "Sientes desorientación por un momento."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:877"
msgid "You summon an angry %s!"
msgstr "¡La criatura %s es invocada llena ira!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:878"
msgid "You summon some angry %s!"
msgstr "¡Un grupo enfadado de %s fueron invocados!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:879"
msgid "You summon a friendly %s!"
msgstr "Invocas a la siguiente agradable criatura: %s"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:880"
msgid " \"I will serve you, master.\""
msgstr " \"Te serviré, su señoría.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:881"
msgid "You summon some friendly %s!"
msgstr "Invocas a la siguiente criatura amistosa: %s"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:882"
msgid " \"We will serve you, master.\""
msgstr " \"Estamos a tu servicio, su señoría.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:883"
msgid "You wipe yourself clean with the towel."
msgstr "Te limpias con la toalla."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:884"
msgid "You bind the towel around your wound."
msgstr "Te vendas la herida con la toalla."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:885"
msgid "You stop bleeding."
msgstr "Dejas de sangrar."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:886"
msgid "You can open tins while carrying the tin opener."
msgstr "Puedes abrir latas siempre que tengas un abrelatas!."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:887"
msgid "Whoops!"
msgstr "¡Upsss!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:888"
msgid ""
"The mirror slips from your grasp.\n"
" It shatters into a million pieces!"
msgstr ""
"Es espejo se resbala de tus manos. \n"
" ¡Se rompe en mil pedacitos!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:889"
msgid "You peer into the mirror..."
msgstr "Echas un vistado al espejo..."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:890"
msgid "You are suddenly whisked away!"
msgstr "¡Y de pronto apareces en otro sitio!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:891"
msgid ""
"You look like a monster!\n"
" The mirror shatters into a million pieces!"
msgstr ""
"¡Pareces un monstruo!\n"
" ¡El espejo se rompe en mil de pedazos!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:892"
msgid "You forget that you're blind for a bit."
msgstr "Olvidas que no puedes ver por un momento."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:893"
msgid "You don't see anyone in the mirror."
msgstr "No ves a nadie en el espejo."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:894"
msgid "'eyyy, boy! *hic*"
msgstr "¡'eyyy, amiigo! *hip*"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:895"
msgid "'eyyy, gurl! *hic*"
msgstr "¡'oiigaa, señoriitah! *hip*"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:896"
msgid "Who is THIS?"
msgstr "¿Quién es ESE?"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:897"
msgid "You look pale!"
msgstr "¡Tu cara está pálida!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:898"
msgid "You look pretty queazy."
msgstr "Sientes bastantes mareos."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:899"
msgid "There's stuff all over your face!"
msgstr "¡Tienes la cara llena de porquerías!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:900"
msgid "You look malnourished."
msgstr "Sientes desnutrición."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:901"
msgid "You look peckish."
msgstr "Sientes hambruna."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:902"
msgid "You look just as ugly as ever."
msgstr "Estás más horrible que una nevera por detrás."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:903"
msgid "You look as handsome as ever!"
msgstr "¡Estás más guapo que nunca!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:904"
msgid "You look as beautiful as ever!"
msgstr "¡Estás más guapa que nunca!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:905"
msgid "The beartrap suddenly breaks!"
msgstr "¡La trampa se rompe de pronto!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:906"
msgid "You set the beartrap."
msgstr "Colocas la trampa."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:907"
msgid "You consume %s."
msgstr "Te tomas tu %s."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:908"
msgid "Blecch! Rotten food!"
msgstr "¡Puaj! ¡Comida pasada!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:909"
msgid ""
"The pie springs into your face!\n"
" *SPLAT*"
msgstr ""
"¡El pastel vuela a tu cara!\n"
" *Chof*"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:910"
msgid "Your face is covered in cream!"
msgstr "¡Tienes la cara llena de crema pastelera!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:911"
msgid "Mmm, tasty!"
msgstr "¡Mmm, dulce!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:912"
msgid "You're still hungry."
msgstr "Aún tienes hambre."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:913"
msgid "You're not quite full yet."
msgstr "Tu estómago no está del todo lleno aún."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:914"
msgid "That %s hit the spot!"
msgstr "%s ha sido la cereza en el pastel!"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:915"
msgid "Oof. You're really full now."
msgstr "Oof. Ahora si que comiste lo suficiente."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:916"
msgid "You feel sick from eating too much."
msgstr "Te duele el estómago de tanto comer."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:917"
msgid "URP! Too much food!"
msgstr "*BURP* ¡Demasiada comida!"

