msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2615"
msgid "\"Brother, I sense someone has arrived. Shall we greet them?\""
msgstr "\"Hermano, presiento que alguien llegó. ¿Debereíasmos introducirnos?\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2616"
msgid "\"No, we are too busy for formalities.\""
msgstr "\"No, estamos demasiado ocupados para formalismos.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2617"
msgid "\"Sister, did you invite company?\""
msgstr "\"Hermana, ¿Has invitado compañía?\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2618"
msgid "\"No, the Guild sent them.\""
msgstr "\"No, fue el Gremio.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2619"
msgid "\"Hm.\""
msgstr "\"Hm.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2620"
msgid "\"Sister, the Cave entrance is still sealed, is it not?\""
msgstr "\"Hermana, la entrada a la Caverna sigue sellada ¿No es así?\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2621"
msgid "\"It is. Why do you ask?\""
msgstr "\"Así es ¿Por qué preguntas?\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2622"
msgid "\"Nevermind. It's nothing.\""
msgstr "\"Da igual. No es nada.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2623"
msgid "\"Is the Minotaur necessary, Brother?\""
msgstr "\"¿Es necesario el Minotauro, Hermano?\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2624"
msgid "\"No, sister, but I do like the show.\""
msgstr "\"No, hermana, pero me entrtetiene el espectáculo.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2625"
msgid "\"Do you think, Sister, they'll flee from the Minotaur?\""
msgstr "\"¿Acaso crees, Hermana, que escaparán del Minotauro?\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2626"
msgid "\"I don't care, Brother. Send it anyway.\""
msgstr "\"No me importa, Hermano. Envíalo de todas maneras.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2627"
msgid "\"This Minotaur has been moping about ever since Herx died.\""
msgstr "\"Este Minotauro ha estado deprimido desde que Herx murió.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2628"
msgid "\"Send it away if it bothers you so much, Sister.\""
msgstr "\"Envíalo de todas maneras si tanto te molesta, Hermana.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2629"
msgid "\"Brother, somebody's making their way through the Caves.\""
msgstr "\"Hermano, alguien se está adentrando en las Cavernas.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2630"
msgid "\"Are you concerned?\""
msgstr "\"¿Estás preocupada?\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2631"
msgid "\"Mmm. No.\""
msgstr "\"Mmm. No.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2632"
msgid "\"The Kobolds guaranteed us better results in the Caves.\""
msgstr "\"Los Kobolds nos garantizaron mejores resultados en las Cavernas.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2633"
msgid "\"Don't worry, Brother. There's still a ways to go, they may yet deliver.\""
msgstr "\"No te preocupes, Hermano. Aún hay camino por recorrer, todavía pueden contribuir.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2634"
msgid "\"Brother, I admit, I wish they'd hurry.\""
msgstr "\"Hermano, debo admitirlo, quisiera que se apresuren.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2635"
msgid "\"It would make things simpler, wouldn't it?\""
msgstr "\"Ciertamente simplificaría el asunto, ¿Verdad?\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2636"
msgid "\"Herx couldn't handle the power he found. We tried to warn him.\""
msgstr "\"Herx no pudo controlar el poder que encontró. Tratamos de advertirle.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2637"
msgid "\"His death was inevitable.\""
msgstr "\"Su muerte fue inevitable.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2652"
msgid "\"Our uninvited guests are nothing but commoners.\""
msgstr "\"Nuestros invitados indeseados no son nada más que simples plebeyos.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2638"
msgid "\"This is all wrong. We created this place for immortals.\""
msgstr "\"Todo está mal. Nosostros creamos este lugar para inmortales.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2639"
msgid "\"Immortals and their servants, Sister.\""
msgstr "\"Immortales y sus sirvientes, Hermana.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2653"
msgid "\"Let them come.\""
msgstr "\"Que vengan.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2640"
msgid "\"How much longer must I wait around?\""
msgstr "\"¿Cuánto más debo estar esperando?\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2641"
msgid "\"Go about your business, Brother. There isn't much to prepare.\""
msgstr "\"Sigue haciendo lo tuyo, Hermano. No hay mucho que preparar.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2642"
msgid "\"You were right to exclude the rest of the guild from our plans here, Brother.\""
msgstr "\"Estabas en lo correcto al excluir el resto del gremio de nuestros planes aquí, Hermano.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2643"
msgid "\"Small minds always have small ambitions.\""
msgstr "\"Mentes pequeñas siempre tienen ambiciones pequeñas.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2644"
msgid "\"Our access to power has only increased since you removed Herx.\""
msgstr "\"Nuestro acceso al poder solo ha incrementado desde que Herx fue removido.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2645"
msgid "\"Allow us to thank you for giving his Barony over to us.\""
msgstr "\"Permítanos agradecerte por entregarnos su Baronía.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2646"
msgid "\"Impossible!!!\""
msgstr "\"¡Imposible!\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2647"
msgid "\"Pest, I will use your soul to undo this offense!\""
msgstr "\"¡Peste, usaré tu alma para deshacer esta ofensa!\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2648"
msgid "\"Curse you!!!\""
msgstr "\"¡Te maldigo!\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2649"
msgid "\"Big mistake, cretin. Time to suffer.\""
msgstr "\"Craso error, cretino. Es hora de sufrir.\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2650"
msgid "\"Ah ha ha ha ha ha haah!!\""
msgstr "\"¡¡Ah ha ha ha ha ha haah!!\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2651"
msgid "\"Ah ha ha ha ha ha ha hah haah!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ah ha ha ha ha ha ha hah haah!\""

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2700"
msgid "type:seq"
msgstr "type:seq"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2701"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" You are quite the party animal, %s. I couldn't keep up with you!"
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Veo que disfrutas mucho del festejo, %s. ¡No logro mantenerme a tu nivel!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2702"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Are you sure you got enough rest, %s?"
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" ¿Realmente has conseguido suficiente descanso, %s?"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2703"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" First you defeat the Baron, and you still out-party a joker like me!"
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" ¡Primero derrotas al Barón y aún logras festejar con más fervor que un fiestero como yo!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2704"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" You're going to take it easy now, though, right %s?"
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Te tomarás las cosas con calma a partir de ahora, ¿Cierto, %s?"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2705"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" ..."
msgstr ""
"[%s]\n"
" ..."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2710"
msgid "type:rand"
msgstr "type:rand"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2711"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Everyone came back to their shops, like nothing happened."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Todo el mundo volvió a sus tiendas, como si nada hubiera sucedido."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2712"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Hamlet's Shopkeepers are tougher after surviving the Baron's dungeon."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Los comerciantes de Hamlet son más duros después de sobrevivir la mazmorra del Barón."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2720"
msgid "type:rand"
msgstr "type:rand"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2721"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" How could I ever thank you %s? *hic!*"
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" ¿Cómo podré agradecerte %s? *hip*"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2722"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I love you, man. Like, seriously, %s, I love you. *hic!*"
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Te amo, colega. Lo digo en serio, %s, Te amo. *hip*"

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2730"
msgid "type:seq"
msgstr "type:seq"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2731"
msgid ""
"%s\n"
" It's a secret to everybody."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Es un secreto para todos."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2732"
msgid ""
"%s\n"
" This used to be the foyer of the Baron's mansion."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Esto solía ser un salón de la mansión del Barón."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2733"
msgid ""
"%s\n"
" We're remodeling the interior for our next ruler."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Estamos remodelando el interior para nuestro siguiente regente."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2734"
msgid ""
"%s\n"
" We want to forget all about Herx."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Queremos olvidar todo lo que nos recuerde a Herx."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2735"
msgid ""
"%s\n"
" It's a secret to everybody."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Es un secreto para todos."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2736"
msgid ""
"%s\n"
" ..."
msgstr ""
"[%s]\n"
" ..."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2740"
msgid "type:seq"
msgstr "type:seq"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2741"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I tried to get into the Crystal Caves, but a barrier stopped me."
msgstr ""
"%s \n"
" Traté de entrar a las Cuevas de Cristal, pero una barrera me detuvo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2742"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Perhaps the Magicians’ Guild erected that barrier."
msgstr ""
"%s \n"
" Quizás el Gremio de Magos erigió esa barrera."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2743"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I'm from a distant city and a member of the Hunters' Guild."
msgstr ""
"%s \n"
" Soy de una ciudad distante, y un miembro del Gremio del Cazador."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2744"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Hamlet's Hunters' Guild isn't in this district."
msgstr ""
"%s \n"
" El Gremio del Cazador de Hamlet no está en este distrito."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2745"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I guess Magicians and Hunters don't get along so well."
msgstr ""
"%s \n"
" Supongo que tanto los Magos como los Cazadores no se llevan muy bien entre sí."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2746"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Hunters kill bad guys. Sometimes they're Magicians."
msgstr ""
"%s \n"
" Los Cazadores matan gente mala. A veces son Magos."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2747"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" No grudges, just don't be a bad guy!"
msgstr ""
"%s \n"
" ¡Sin rencores, simplemente no seas uno de los malos!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2748"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" ..."
msgstr ""
"[%s]\n"
" ..."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2750"
msgid "type:rand"
msgstr "type:rand"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2751"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Is it strange that I am tempted to go back into the mine?"
msgstr ""
"%s \n"
" ¿Sería raro si siento la tentación de volver a las minas?"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2752"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" The sky out here is so large. I'm scared."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" El cielo allá afuera es tan grande. Tengo miedo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2753"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" The mines, Herx's dungeon, is on the other side of this gate."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Las minas, la mazmorra de Herx, está todo al otro lado de esta puerta."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2754"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Maybe I'll just go back for a little while."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Quizás vuelva por un rato."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2760"
msgid "type:seq"
msgstr "type:seq"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2761"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" The Magicians' Guild must be up to something."
msgstr ""
"%s \n"
" El Gremio de Magos debe estar tramando algo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2762"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Guilds always have too many secrets."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Los Gremios siempre tienen secretos entre manos."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2763"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I heard that Merlin and the Magicians' Guild had a falling out."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Escuché que Merlín y el Gremio de Magos tuvieron un desacuerdo mutuo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2764"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I bet Herx is in tight with Archmagisters Orpheus and Erudyce."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Apuesto a que Herx tramó algo con los Archimagos Orfeo y Erudyce."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2765"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Don't get me started on the Hunters' Guild."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" No me hagas empezar con el Gremio del Cazador..."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2766"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I heard the Masons' Guild works for the Church."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Escuché que el Gremio de Masones trabaja para la Iglesia."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2767"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" The Church has secrets, but they also help the poor."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" La Iglesia tiene sus secretos, pero también ayudan a los pobres."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2768"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Is the Church a Guild? Asking for a friend."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" ¿La Iglesia es un gremio? Pregunto por un amigo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2769"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" ..."
msgstr ""
"[%s]\n"
" ..."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2770"
msgid "type:seq"
msgstr "type:seq"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2771"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Welcome back, %s. I hope you're rested."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Qué gusto verte de nuevo, %s. Espero que hayas podido descansar."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2772"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" The magicians inside can explain everything."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Los magos que están dentro podrán explicarlo todo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2773"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Me? No, I'm just a doorman."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" ¿Yo? No, tan solo soy un portero."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2774"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Many come and go, %s. No membership required."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Muchos vienen y van, %s. No se requiere membresía."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2775"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Merlin used to come by a lot, but then he just stopped."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Merlín solía venir aquí muy seguido, pero después se detuvo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2776"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Come to think of it, Herx used to come by regularly."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Ahora que lo pienso, Herx solía venir aquí regularmente."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2777"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Herx would always leave angry after every visit."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Herx siempre salía furioso después de cada visita."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2778"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I wish I could've seen Herx's face when you showed up..."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Desearía haberle visto la cara a Herx cuando apareciste..."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2779"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" ..."
msgstr ""
"[%s]\n"
" ..."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2780"
msgid "type:seq"
msgstr "type:seq"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2781"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" The Baron wanted to set up the mine in the Crystal Caves."
msgstr ""
"%s \n"
" El Barón quería montar las minas en las Cuevas de Cristal."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2782"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" The Archmagisters refused to allow Herx to mine there."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Los Archimagos se negaron a permitirle a Herx minar allí."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2783"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Herx offered a lot of grants to the Magicians' Guild."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Herx ofreció muchos subsidios al Gremio de Magos."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2784"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I think Herx expected favors from the Archmagisters."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Creo que Herx esperaba favores de los Archimagos."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2785"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Eventually, Herx gave up on getting the help of the Guild."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Eventualmente Herx desistió de obtener ayuda del Gremio."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2786"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Things turned out bad, but they could've been worse."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Las cosas empeoraron, pero pudieron haber sido mucho peor."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2787"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" ..."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" ..."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2790"
msgid "type:seq"
msgstr "type:seq"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2791"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Merlin told us about the dangerous magic Herx found."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Merlín nos dijo sobre la peligrosa magia que Herx encontró."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2792"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" We never heard from Merlin again after he left to stop Herx."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Nosotros nunca volvimos a escuchar sobre Merlín después de que se fuera para detener a Herx."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2793"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I heard rumors about a new letter from Merlin, but I never saw it."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Escuché rumores sobre una carta de Merlín, pero nunca la vi."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2794"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" You know, Merlin was never an official member of the Magicians’ Guild."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Tu sabes, Merlín nunca fue un miembro oficial del Gremio de Magos."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2795"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Some people just need their independence. I respect that."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Algunas personas simplemente necesitan su independencia. Puedo respetar eso."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2796"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" ..."
msgstr ""
"[%s]\n"
" ..."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2800"
msgid "type:seq"
msgstr "type:seq"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2801"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" After Herx was locked away, the Archmagisters went to the Crystal Caves."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Después del encierro de Herx, los Archimagos fueron a las Cavernas de Cristal."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2802"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I guess they wanted to see what all the fuss was about."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Supongo que querían ver qué tenía de interesante."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2803"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" If it wasn't for the Archmagisters, Herx would've built an army here."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Si no fuera por los Archimagos, Herx hubiera creado un ejército aquí."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2804"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" We never would've been able to figure out how to lock Herx away. "
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Nosotros nunca hubiéramos encontrado la forma de encerrar a Herx lejos de aquí. "

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2805"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I think Erudyce and Orpheus knew sealing up Herx wouldn't be enough."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Creo que Erudyce y Orfeo sabían que encerrar a Herx no sería suficiente."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2806"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" ..."
msgstr ""
"[%s]\n"
" ..."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2810"
msgid "type:seq"
msgstr "type:seq"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2811"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Powerful monsters started coming from the Crystal Caves."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Monstruos poderosos comenzaron a salir de las Cavernas de Cristal."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2812"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" The Guild had to seal the Caves to keep Hamlet from being destroyed."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" El Gremio tuvo que sellar las Cavernas para evitar que Hamlet fuera destruida."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2813"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I hope that the Archmagisters inside are alright."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Espero que los Archimagos estén bien ahí dentro."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2814"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I really hope those monsters have nothing to do with their research."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Realmente espero que no haya relación entre monstruos y las investigaciones que estaban realizando."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2815"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Orpheus is so driven. Nothing can stop him."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Orfeo tiene mucha determinación. Nada lo puede detener."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2816"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Erudyce likes to influence things from behind the scenes."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" A Erudyce le gusta influenciar las cosas desde detrás de escenas."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2817"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" ..."
msgstr ""
"[%s]\n"
" ..."

msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2820"
msgid "type:seq"
msgstr "type:seq"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2821"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I sensed power from the orb when you put it on that pedestal."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Presentí un poder emanar del orbe cuando lo colocaste en el pedestal."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2822"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I wonder why Herx didn't use that power to escape the dungeon."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Me pregunto por qué Herx no usó ese poder para escapar de la mazmorra."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2823"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I was able to trap some of the power that Herx's orb released."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Fui capaz de atrapar parte del poder que liberó el orbe de Herx."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2824"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" This portal pierces the seal to the Caves using the power of the orb."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Este portal penetra el sello de las Cavernas usando el poder del orbe."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2825"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Archmagisters Orpheus and Erudyce will help return things to normal."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Los Archimagos Orfeo y Erudyce ayudarán a volver las cosas a la normalidad."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:2826"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" They must have learned something about the power Herx found."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Deben haber aprendido algo sobre el poder que encontró Herx."

