#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:10"
msgid ""
"A skilled combatant. What they lack in armor they make up for in strength and fighting\n"
"prowess.\n"
"Difficulty: Normal"
msgstr ""
"Combatiente habilidoso. Lo que carecen en armadura lo compensan en fuerza \n"
"y pericia en combate.\n"
"Dificultad: Normal"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:11"
msgid ""
"The trained soldier. They are heavily armored and make capable leaders.\n"
"\n"
"Difficulty: Beginner"
msgstr ""
"Soldado entrenado. Están fuertemente acorazados y son líderes capaces.\n"
"\n"
"Dificultad: Fácil"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:12"
msgid ""
"A talented physician. Though they are poor fighters, they come stocked with medical\n"
"supplies and other healing abilities.\n"
"Difficulty: Normal"
msgstr ""
"Médico talentoso. Aunque son luchadores incapaces, vienen abastecidos \n"
"con suministros médicos y otras habilidades curativas.\n"
"Dificultad: Normal"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:13"
msgid ""
"The professional hooligan. Dextrous and skilled thieves, though lacking in power and\n"
"equipment.\n"
"Difficulty: Hard"
msgstr ""
"Rufián profesiónal. Ladrones diestros y siniestros, \n"
"aunque carentes de poder y equipo.\n"
"Dificultad: Difícil"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:14"
msgid ""
"Hardened traveler. Low in armor and combat ability, but well-equipped for the dungeon.\n"
"\n"
"Difficulty: Normal"
msgstr ""
"Viajero curtido. Flojo en armadura y pericia en combate, \n"
"pero bien equipado para la mazmorra.\n"
"Dificultad: Normal"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:15"
msgid ""
"Students of the church. Fairly well equipped and able in many ways, they are\n"
"well-rounded adventurers.\n"
"Difficulty: Beginner"
msgstr ""
"Estudiante eclesiástico. Bastante bien equipados \n"
"y capaces en muchos sentidos, son aventureros completos.\n"
"Dificultad: Fácil"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:16"
msgid ""
"A seasoned trader. They are skilled in the market and adept at identifying foreign\n"
"artifacts.\n"
"Difficulty: Hard"
msgstr ""
"Comerciante experimentado. Son expertos del comercio \n"
"y adeptos a la hora de identificar artefactos foráneos.\n"
"Dificultad: Difícil"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:17"
msgid ""
"The wise magician. Though frail, they are extremely well-versed in magic.\n"
"\n"
"Difficulty: Hard"
msgstr ""
"Mago erudito. Aunque frágil, está íntimamente interiorizado\n"
"en magias.\n"
"Dificultad: Difícil"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:18"
msgid ""
"A cunning spellcaster. Less magically adept than the Wizard, but hardier and better\n"
"equipped.\n"
"Difficulty: Normal"
msgstr ""
"Astuto lanzador de hechizos. Menos adepto mágicamente que el mago, \n"
"pero más resistente y mejor equipado.\n"
"Dificultad: Normal"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:19"
msgid ""
"The wild card. Jokers come with very little equipment, but they have a few tricks up\n"
"their sleeves nonetheless.\n"
"Difficulty: Extreme"
msgstr ""
"Carta comodín. Los Guazones vienen ligeros de equipo, \n"
"sin embargo poseen algunos trucos bajo la manga.\n"
"Dificultad: Extrema "

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
