"Weaknesses:\n"
"Maces, polearms, blessed water\n"
"\n"
"Resistances: \n"
"Swords, ranged, axes, magic\n"
"\n"
"Traits:\n"
"- Cannot starve, or eat\n"
"   (Potions still apply as normal)\n"
"- Self-resurrection at 75 MP\n"
"- 25% HP/MP regeneration rate\n"
"- 50% water movement speed\n"
"- Immune to burning"
msgstr ""
"Esqueleto\n"
"\n"
"Aliados: \n"
"Necrófagos, Autómatas\n"
"\n"
"Debilidades:\n"
"Mazas, armas de asta, agua bendita\n"
"\n"
"Resistencias: \n"
"Espadas, distancia, hachas, magia\n"
"\n"
"Razgos:\n"
"- No sufre hambruna, ni puede comer\n"
"   (Pociones funcionan con normalidad)\n"
"- Auto-resurrección con 75 MP\n"
"- Tasa de regeneración de 25% HP/MP\n"
"- 50% velocidad de movimiento en agua\n"
"- Inmune a quemaduras"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3377"
msgid ""
"Vampire\n"
"\n"
"Friendly with: \n"
"Vampires, Automatons\n"
"\n"
"Weaknesses:\n"
"Maces, polearms, water, solid foods\n"
"\n"
"Resistances: \n"
"Swords, ranged, axes, magic\n"
"\n"
"Traits:\n"
"- Converts HP to MP when casting\n"
"   spells at 0 MP\n"
"- Starts with Bloodletting and\n"
"   Levitation spells learnt\n"
"- Can only consume vials of blood to\n"
"   sustain hunger\n"
"- Vials of blood drop on kills\n"
"   (Higher chance if bleeding or \n"
"    landing sneak attacks)"
msgstr ""
"Vampiro\n"
"\n"
"Aliados: \n"
"Vampiros, Autómatas\n"
"\n"
"Debilidades:\n"
"Mazas, armas de asta, agua, comida sólida\n"
"\n"
"Resistencias: \n"
"Espadas, distancia, hachas, magia\n"
"\n"
"Razgos:\n"
"- Convierte HP en MP al lanzar\n"
"   hechizos con 0 MP\n"
"- Comienza con los hechizos\n"
"   Ensangrentar y Levitación ya aprendidos\n"
"- Solo puede consumir frascos de sangre\n"
"  para combatir el hambre\n"
"- Frascos de sangre caen con cada muerte\n"
"   (Mayor chance con sangrado o\n"
"    lidiando ataques furtivos)"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3378"
msgid ""
"Succubus\n"
"\n"
"Friendly with: \n"
"Succubi, Incubi, Automatons\n"
"\n"
"Weaknesses:\n"
"Swords\n"
"\n"
"Resistances: \n"
"Magic, polearms\n"
"\n"
"Traits:\n"
"- Cursed equipment is removable\n"
"   and provides bonuses each curse\n"
"- Blessed gear is unremovable\n"
"   (Still provides bonuses)\n"
"- Starts with Teleportation spell\n"
"   learnt\n"
"- Can recruit drunk/confused humans"
msgstr ""
"Súcubo\n"
"\n"
"Aliados: \n"
"Súcubos, Íncubos, Autómatas\n"
"\n"
"Debilidades:\n"
"Espadas\n"
"\n"
"Resistencias: \n"
"Magia, armas de asta\n"
"\n"
"Razgos:\n"
"- Equipamiento maldito es removible y\n"
"  provee bonificaciones por cada uno\n"
"- Equipamiento bendito es irremovible\n"
"   (Aún proveen bonificaciones)\n"
"- Comienza con Teletransporte\n"
"   ya aprendido\n"
"- Puede reclutar humanos ebrios/con-\n"
"   fundidos"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3379"
msgid ""
"Goatman\n"
"\n"
"Friendly with: \n"
"Goatmen, Automatons\n"
"\n"
"Weaknesses:\n"
"Magic, axes, polearms, ranged\n"
"\n"
"Resistances: \n"
"Swords\n"
"\n"
"Traits:\n"
"- Fountains have a chance to drop\n"
"   1-3 random potions on use\n"
"- Increased STR/CHR while drunk\n"
"   (Immune to drunk dizziness)\n"
"- Suffers intermittent hangovers that\n"
"   can be cured by intoxication\n"
"- Can eat tin cans without an opener\n"
"- Can recruit humans/goblins by\n"
"   throwing booze while drunk"
msgstr ""
"Fauno\n"
"\n"
"Aliados: \n"
"Faunos, Autómatas\n"
"\n"
"Debilidades:\n"
"Magia, hachas, armas de asta, distancia\n"
"\n"
"Resistencias: \n"
"Espadas\n"
"\n"
"Razgos:\n"
"- Fuentes tiene chance de soltar\n"
"   1-3 pociones al azar por uso\n"
"- Incrementa FUE/CHR si está ebrio\n"
"   (Inmune a confusión alcohólica)\n"
"- Sufre de resacas intermitentes que\n"
"   se pueden curan por intoxicación\n"
"- Puede comer latas sin abrelatas\n"
"- Puede reclutar humanos/trasgos al\n"
"   arrojarles bebidas estando ebrio"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3380"
msgid ""
"Automaton\n"
"\n"
"Friendly with: \n"
"Humans, Automatons\n"
"\n"
"Weaknesses:\n"
"Maces, axes, magic\n"
"\n"
"Resistances: \n"
"Ranged, unarmed\n"
"\n"
"Traits:\n"
"- Require Heat (HT) to survive and\n"
"   cast spells\n"
"- Consuming gemstones, scrolls, \n"
"   non-spell books and scrap adds HT\n"
"- Cursed items can be unequipped\n"
"- Neutral to Incubi and Succubi\n"
"- Immune to burning\n"
"- Bonus +20 Tinkering to repairs\n"
"- Starts with Salvage spell learnt"
msgstr ""
"Autómata\n"
"\n"
"Aliados: \n"
"Humanos, Autómatas\n"
"\n"
"Debilidades:\n"
"Mazas, hachas, magia\n"
"\n"
"Resistencias: \n"
"Distancia, desarmado\n"
"\n"
"Razgos:\n"
"- Requiere calor (HT) para sobrevivir y\n"
"   lanzar hechizos\n"
"- Consumir gemas, pergaminos, \n"
"   libros no mágicos y chatarra suma HT\n"
"- Objetos malditos pueden ser desequipados\n"
"- Neutrales para Íncubos y Súcubos\n"
"- Inmune a quemaduras\n"
"- Bonificación +20 en Fabricar para reparar\n"
"- Comienza con Reciclar aprendido"

