#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3771"
msgid ""
"You arrive outside the Hamlet mines and watch the cursed blackness peel away\n"
"from the land. Warm sunlight flows over the countryside. As the doors of the\n"
"mine open wide, people carefully spread into the streets, acclimating to\n"
"their freedom."
msgstr ""
"Llegas a las afueras de las Minas de Hamlet y observas una oscura maldición disipándose de la tierra.\n"
"La cálida luz del sol fluye sobre el campo. Conforme las puertas de la mina se abren, las personas\n"
"cuidadosamente se esparcen por las calles, adaptándose a la libertad."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3772"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You rush to nearby buildings, looking for a place to hide and figure out your\n"
"next move. There are too many humans and the sun is too bright for your liking."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Corres hacia edificios cercanos, buscando un lugar para esconderte y planear el próximo movimiento.\n"
"Hay demasiados humanos y la luz de sol es demasiado brillante para tu gusto."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3773"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You break your way into what appears to be an inn. You spend the night under\n"
"the sheets of a comfortable bed while the sounds of revelry surround you."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Entras a lo que parece ser una posada. Pasas la noche debajo de las mantas de una cómoda cama mientras los \n"
"sonidos de joglorio te rodean."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3774"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Luckily you avoid detection. As humans party through the hostel you hear of\n"
"a power even greater than Herx's, said to be held in the Magician's Guild."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Milagrosamente evitas la detección. A medida que los humanos festejan en el albergue, escuchas un poder aún\n"
"mayor que el de Herx, supuestamente oculto en el Gremio de Magos."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3775"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"A trapdoor in the bunkroom leads to a sewer. You wait for the humans to leave."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Una escotilla en el dormitorio lleva a una alcantarilla. Esperas a que los humanos se vayan."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3776"
msgid ""
"Hacking your way through every demon in your path, you leap through the\n"
"portal without a moment's hesitation. No entity, mortal or immortal, can\n"
"challenge your power."
msgstr ""
"Abriéndote camino a través de cada demonio, cruzas un portal sin dudarlo. Pareciera que ninguna entidad,\n"
" mortal o inmortal, puede desafiar tu inmenso poder."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3777"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, you find yourself standing wearily in an endless white hall dotted\n"
"with enormous pillars that stretch higher than you can see. The smell of\n"
"blood is thick on your breath, but you suspect more will need to be spilled."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Repentinamente y con cansancio te encuentras ante un pasillo infinito de color blanco, repleto de pilares\n"
" enormes que se extienden más alto de lo que puedes ver.\n"
"El olor a sangre se siente denso en el aire, pero sospechas que aún más deberá ser derramada."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3778"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Can this supernatural place compete with Minotaurs, Demons; Baphomet himself?\n"
"You sense a great magic flow into the room. You are unnerved. A voice booms:"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"¿Acaso puede este lugar sobrenatural competir con Minotauros, Demonios y el mismísimo Baphomet?\n"
"Sientes un gran flujo mágico en la sala. Sientes ansiedad. Una voz explota:"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3779"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\"We have witnessed your strength and lust for power. You were not expected here.\n"
"We are however impressed by your ferocity and focus. We ask you consider this\n"
"proposition, mighty one...\""
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\"Hemos sido testigos de tu fuerza y megalomanía. Aunque no esperábamos a alguien como tú, estamos \n"
"impresionados por tu ferocidad y enfoque.\n"
"Pedimos que consideres esta proposición, poderoso indiviuo...\""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3780"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"As the voice addresses you, you find you are tempted by its words. It speaks\n"
"of a power greater than Herx, or Baphomet. It claims that it is greater than\n"
"you. The prospect of a competitor shall not stand."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"A medida que la voz se dirige hacia ti, sientes una cierta tentación por sus palabra. Eso habla\n"
"de un poder aún mayor que el de Herx, o Baphomet. Dice ser aún más poderoso que ti.\n"
"La idea de un competidor no será aceptada."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3781"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You find yourself standing inside a Hamlet inn, its denizens too drunk or \n"
"weary to notice you at first. You steal yourself into a backroom; a trapdoor\n"
"leads to a sewer. A great magic from beyond there beckons you."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Te encuentras dentro de una posada en Hamlet, sus habitantes están demasiado ebrios para notar tu presencia al\n"
"comienzo. Te escabulles hacia un cuarto;una escotilla conduce hacia las alcantarillas. Una gran magia en su\n"
"interior te atrae."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3782"
msgid ""
"Hacking your way through every demon in your path, you leap through the\n"
"portal without a moment's hesitation. No entity, mortal or immortal, can\n"
"challenge your power."
msgstr ""
"Abriéndote camino a través de cada demonio, cruzas un portal sin dudarlo. Pareciera que ninguna entidad,\n"
"mortal o inmortal, puede desafiar tu inmenso poder."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3783"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, you find yourself standing wearily in an endless white hall dotted\n"
"with enormous pillars that stretch higher than you can see. Have you not\n"
"defeated the source of Herx's vile power? You wonder what danger now awaits."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Repentinamente y con cansancio te encuentras ante un pasillo infinito de color blanco, repleto de pilares \n"
"enormes que se extienden más alto de lo que puedes ver ¿Acaso no has conseguido vencer la fuente del poder\n"
"vil de Herx? Te preguntas qué peligro está al acecho."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3784"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"A sense of peace overwhelms and refreshes you. You know that Herx's power has\n"
"been removed. But Baphomet was just one devil. A voice comforts you:"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Una sensación de paz te envuelve y revitaliza. Sabes que el poder de Herx fue removido. Pero Baphomet \n"
"era apenas un demonio. Una voz te consuela:"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3785"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\"The lich Herx has become dust, but cleverer foes draw upon hellish evil.\n"
"Hamlet is free for now, but the world is not safe. In times such as these\n"
"a mighty one must tip the scales. We have a proposition for you...\""
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\"El liche Herx ahora es polvo, pero enemigos más astutos recurren al mal infernal.\n"
"Hamlet está a salvo por el momento, pero el mundo aún no es seguro. En tiempos como estos uno debe\n"
"inclinar la balanza. Tenemos una proposición para ofrecerte...\""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3786"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"As the voice addresses you, you find yourself either unwilling or unable to\n"
"reject what it tells you. You find your physical form shifting back into the\n"
"mortal realm. \"You must sever evil from Hamlet or there will be no peace.\""
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"A medida que la voz se dirige hacia ti, te encuentras o renuente o incapaz de rechazar sus palabras.\n"
"Notas a tu forma física retornando al mundo mortal. \"Debes cortar el mal de Hamlet o nunca habrá paz\""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3787"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"With renewed courage, you find yourself standing in Hamlet. Evidence of a\n"
"massive party flows from the gates of the mines, now open, to a nearby hostel.\n"
"You know the Magician's Guild will aid you in your quest."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Con el coraje renovado, te encuentras nuevamente en Hamlet. Evidencia de un gran festejo\n"
"fluye desde los portones hasta las minas, ahora abiertas, hacia una posada cercana.\n"
"Sabes que el Gremio de Magos te brindará ayuda en tu misión.."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3788"
msgid ""
"Victorious, you step into the portal. You know not what to expect, but \n"
"are awash with delight. You expect that the source of the Baron's power \n"
"is now within your reach."
msgstr ""
"Victoriosamente, entras en el portal. No sabes qué esperar, pero sientes una inmensa\n"
"alegría. Sospechas que la fuente del poder del Barón está a tu alcance."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3789"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Before you have time to think, you are suddenly standing before the mines \n"
"once more. But something is different; the seductive power you sensed here \n"
"is further away. The black skies are clearing to show the light of day."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Antes de tener tiempo para pensar, te encuentras repentinamente en las minas otra vez. \n"
"Pero hay algo diferente; el poder seductor que has sentido aquí está más lejos.\n"
"El cielo negro se aclara para mostrar la luz diurna."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3790"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, the doors to the mine open wide. Sealed for centuries to contain \n"
"the evil within, they swing out from the inside, as a hundred grateful humans \n"
"rush out. It appears the Baron's power slipped through your grasp."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Repentinamente, las puertas de la mina se abre de lado a lado. Sellado durante \n"
"siglos para contener un mal en su interior, ellos se abalanzan desde dentro, \n"
"cientos de humanos agredecidos salen corriendo.\n"
"Parece que el poder del Barón se escapó de tus manos."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3791"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The hellish source of that dark power remains a mystery to you, and some\n"
"eavedropping from the shadows leads you to believe that the Magician's Guild\n"
"may have a lead on some dark magic. For now, you resolve to leave this land\n"
"and return another time to exploit the secrets of Hamlet."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"La infernal fuente del poder oscuro permanece un misterio para ti, y algunos\n"
"sonidos provenientes de las sombras te lleva a pensar que el Gremio de Magos\n"
"puede tener una pista sobre alguna magia oscura. Por ahora, tu decides dejar\n"
"esta tierra y retornar en otro momento para explorar los secretos de Hamlet."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3792"
msgid ""
"Hacking your way through every demon in your path, you leap through the\n"
"portal without a moment's hesitation. It seems no entity, mortal or \n"
"immortal, can challenge your power."
msgstr ""
"Abriéndote camino a través de cada demonio, saltas hacia un portal sin \n"
"dudarlo. Pareciera que ninguna entidad, mortal o inmortal, puede desafiar \n"
"tu inmenso poder."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3793"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, you find yourself standing wearily in an endless white hall dotted\n"
"with enormous pillars that stretch higher than you can see. The smell of\n"
"blood is thick on your breath, but you suspect more will need to be spilled."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Repentinamente te encuentras ante un pasillo infinito de color blanco, repleto\n"
"de pilares enormes que se extienden más alto de lo que puedes ver.\n"
"El olor a sangre se siente denso en el aire, pero sospechas que aún más deberá\n"
"ser derramada."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3794"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Can this supernatural place compete with Minotaurs, Demons; Baphomet himself?\n"
"You sense a great magic flow into the room. You are unnerved. A voice booms:"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"¿Acaso puede este lugar sobrenatural competir con Minotauros, Demonios y el \n"
"mismísimo Baphomet?\n"
"Percibes un gran flujo mágico en la sala. Sientes ansiedad. Una voz explota:"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3795"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\"We have witnessed your strength and lust for power. You were not expected here.\n"
"We are however impressed by your ferocity and focus. We ask you consider this\n"
"proposition, mighty one...\""
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\"Hemos sido testisgos de tu fuerza y megalomanía. Aunque no esperábamos a alguien\n"
"como tú, estamos impresionados por tu ferocidad y enfoque.\n"
"Pedimos que consideres esta proposición, poderoso individuo...\"\""

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3796"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"As the voice addresses you, you find yourself either unwilling or unable to\n"
"reject what it tells you. Eventually, there is an inexplicable shift in your\n"
"physical being, and you feel yourself fading away..."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"A medida que la voz se dirige hacia ti, te encuentras o renuente o incapaz de rechazar\n"
"sus palabras. Eventualmente hay un cambio inexplicable en tu forma física, y comienzas\n"
"a sentir que te desvaneces..."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3797"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You sense the supreme power of a great mind as you fade from the mortal world. \n"
"The first age comes to a close, and the age of chaos begins. You are sure that\n"
"your time is emminent and your purpose will be fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Percibes el poder supremo de una gran mente mientras te desvaneces del mundo mortal.\n"
"La primera edad llega a su fin, y la edad del caos comienza. Sabes con certeza que\n"
"tu fin es inminente y tu propósito será cumplido."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3798"
msgid ""
"Through the portal, a weak magic tugs you from the Citadel. Your feet \n"
"hover over the floor as it shakes violently. Pipes and pistons crash down \n"
"in a muffled racket. Your inputs are dulled and you observe the transferrence\n"
"of your consciousness."
msgstr ""
"A través del portal, una débil magia te empuja desde la Ciudadela. Tus pies flotan\n"
"por encima del suelo mientras tiemblan violentamente. Tuberías y pistones caen en\n"
"un estruendo. Tus sentidos se entorpecen y observas la transferencia de tu ser."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3799"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"It seems demonic evil has been destroyed, at least, as far as Hamlet knows."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Parece que la maldad demoníaca fue destruida, al menos, hasta donde Hamlet sabe."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3800"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You consider its citizens are lucky to have you. They could not have survived\n"
"without you, but alas, you would never have been invented without them."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Consideras que los cuidadanos tiene suerte de tenerte. Podrían no haber \n"
"sobrevivido de no ser por ti, sin embargo, nunca hubieses sido creado\n"
"de no ser por ellos.."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3801"
msgid ""
"Your systems are nominal. You stand with a wizard and bishop. Their\n"
"faces open into expressions of surprise."
msgstr ""
"Tus sistemas son nominales. Te encuentras junto un mago y un obispo.\n"
"Sus caras muestran expresiones de sorpresa."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3802"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"They are shocked to see that a humble slave, a servant... an automaton has\n"
"rescued them from supernatural evil. Is your inhuman nature the reason?"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Están anonadados al ver que un humilde esclavo, un sirviente... un autómata\n"
"los ha rescatado del mal sobrenatural ¿Es tu naturaleza inhumana la razón?"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3803"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The guilds and the churches agree, there is no more perfect arbiter for the\n"
"well being of humans. You are entrusted with the tasks of law, assumed to\n"
"have perfect objectivity as the new Baron. Your rulings are infallible."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Los gremios e iglesias están de acuerdo, no hay un árbitro más perfecto para\n"
"el bienestar de los humanos. Te encargan con las tareas de la ley, asumiendo\n"
"que posees perfecta objetividad para ser el nuevo Barón. Tus decisiones son\n"
"infalibles."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3804"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"But is that so? What is it that makes you conscious? You lead Hamlet to\n"
"its former glory. But you think some problems may require more power."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"¿Pero será así? ¿Qué es lo que te hace consciente? Conduces a Hamlet\n"
"hacia su antigua gloria ¿Pero piensas que sus problemas requieren \n"
"aún más poder?"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3805"
msgid ""
"Through the portal, a weak magic tugs you from the Citadel. Your feet \n"
"hover over the floor as it shakes violently. Pipes and pistons crash down \n"
"in a muffled racket. You clench your eyes knowing magic holds you tight.\n"
"You grimly await what it offers."
msgstr ""
"A través del portal, una débil magia te empuja desde la Ciudadela. Tus pies flotan\n"
"por encima del suelo mientras tiemblan violentamente. Tuberías y pistones caen en\n"
"un estruendo. Cierras los ojos sabiendo que la magia te sujeta con firmeza.\n"
"Sombríamente esperas lo que tiene para ofrecerte"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3806"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"If the liches gained their powers from devils, what does that make you\n"
"who ended them? Is it now yours to bear? What use was it to them?"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Si los liches ganaron sus poderes pactando con demonios ¿Qué dice eso de ti quien\n"
"acabó con ellos? ¿Ahora es tu responsabilidad? ¿Cuál era la gracia para ellos?"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3807"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"It seems you got what you came here for, though not in the way you\n"
"anticipated. Power cannot just be held, it must be used."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Parece que has obtenido lo que esperabas, aunque no de la manera que\n"
"anticipabas. El poder no puede ser contenido, debe ser usado."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3808"
msgid ""
"You open your eyes and find yourself standing with two mortals. \n"
"They cower in your presence. You command them to bow before you."
msgstr ""
"Abres los ojos y te encuentras entre dos mortales. Escabullen del miedo\n"
"ante tu presencia. Les ordenas que se inclinen ante ti."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3809"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Through demonic magic, you bind their souls hostage in servitude, using\n"
"their influence to bend factions to your secret purpose."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Mediante magia demoníaca, esclavizas sus almas a tu servidumbre, usando\n"
"su influencia para manipular las facciones hacia tu propósito secreto."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3810"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The following years are not easy for the surface world. Eventually they learn\n"
"that joy and glory is found in strength. You slaughter all who oppose you.\n"
"Eventually they embrace your nature. The humans bear your banner."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Los años venideros no son fáciles para el mundo exterior. Eventualmente aprenden\n"
"que la alegría y la gloria provienen de la fuerza. Masacras a quienquiera se\n"
"oponga en tu contra. Eventualmente aprenden a aceptar tu naturaleza. Los humanos\n"
"llevan tu estandarte."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3811"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Can any empire challenge what you've built? Prophets teach that the\n"
"human spirit is stronger than anything. You fear that power is real."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"¿Puede algún imperio desafiar lo que has construido? Profetas enseñan\n"
"que el espíritu humano lo soporta todo. Temes que tal cosa sea real."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3812"
msgid ""
"Through the portal, a weak magic tugs you from the Citadel. Your feet \n"
"hover over the floor as it shakes violently. Pipes and pistons crash down\n"
"in a muffled racket. You try to shake your terror and close your eyes."
msgstr ""
"A través del portal, una débil magia te empuja desde la Ciudadela. Tus pies flotan\n"
"por encima del suelo mientras tiemblan violentamente. Tuberías y pistones caen en\n"
"un estruendo. Tratas de soportar el terror y cierras los ojos."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3813"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"What have you to be afraid of? You have defeated mighty, evil masters.\n"
"Who can challenge your people now?"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"¿A qué le temes? Has vencido oponentes poderosos y malignos. \n"
"¿Quién puede desafiar a los tuyos ahora? "

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3814"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You fear nothing. No, it is others who should fear you. A moment of clarity\n"
"causes you to wonder if fear is what you want from others."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"No le temes a nada. No, son los otros quienes deben temerte. Un momento de\n"
"claridad causa que te preguntes si el miedo es lo que deseas despertar en\n"
"otros"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3815"
msgid ""
"You open your eyes, standing in The Magician's Guild with a wizard and bishop. \n"
"Their faces are confused, but they await your reaction with patient wonder."
msgstr ""
"Abres los ojos y te encuentras junto un mago y un obispo. Sus\n"
"caras muestran expresiones de confusión, pero esperan tu reacción\n"
"con paciente admiración."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3816"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You suspect things may've gone differently if wiser men had not awaited you.\n"
"They recognized your heroism and offered gratitude for your deeds. Are these\n"
"the same people who murdered your kind so recently?"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Sospechas que las cosas pudieran haber ido mejor si hombres más sabios no\n"
"te hubieran esperado. Ellos reconocen tu heroísmo y ofrecen gratitud por tus\n"
"hazañas ¿Son éstas las mismas personas que trataron de asesinar los tuyos\n"
"tan recientemente?"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3817"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Though shaky at first, your peoples build an alliance toward peace."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Aunque temblando al comienzo, los tuyos construyen una alianza a favor\n"
"de la paz."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3818"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Through your example, insectoids, humans, goatmen and goblins embrace courage\n"
"instead of fear. Trade prospers in Hamlet as people belay their lust for power."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Mediante tus acciones, insectoides, humanos, faunos y trasgos acogen el coraje\n"
"en lugar del miedo. El comercio prospera en Hamlet a medida que las personas\n"
"abandonan sus ansias de poder."

