#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3975"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
" Enabling Crossplay allows joining and hosting of multiplayer lobbies\n"
"  between different distributions of Barony without port forwarding.\n"
"\n"
"         For more information, click \"About Crossplay\" below.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"      By clicking accept, you agree to share your public Steam ID \n"
"    and display name with Barony and associated Crossplay services."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
" Habilitar Crossplay permite conectar y crear salas multijugador entre \n"
"  diferentes distribuciones de Barony sin tener que abrir puertos.\n"
"\n"
"         Para más información, cliquear \"Sobre Crossplay\" debajo.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"      Al cliquear aceptar, tu estarás de acuerdo con compartir tu ID y nombre \n"
"      público de Steam con Barony y servicios asociados de Crossplay."

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3976"
msgid "Accept and Enable Crossplay"
msgstr "Aceptar y Habilitar Crossplay"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3977"
msgid "Cancel Setup"
msgstr "Cancelar Configuración"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3978"
msgid "View Privacy Policy"
msgstr "Ver Política de Privacidad"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3979"
msgid "                      Crossplay First-Time Setup"
msgstr "                      Crossplay First-Time Setup"

#. Versiones: 3.3.7
msgctxt "lang/en.txt:3980"
msgid ""
"About Crossplay\n"
"\n"
"           Barony uses Epic Online Services to facilitate Crossplay,\n"
"           and will create a unique Crossplay ID within Barony that \n"
"              corresponds to your public facing Steam account ID.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"      Your public Steam account ID and display name will be shared with\n"
"    the service and other players when using Crossplay features in Barony.\n"
"      No third party account is required or created when using Crossplay.\n"
"\n"
"    Click \"View Privacy Policy\" below to see how Barony handles your data."
msgstr ""
"Sobre Crossplay\n"
"\n"
"           Barony uses Epic Online Services to facilitate Crossplay,\n"
"           and will create a unique Crossplay ID within Barony that \n"
"              corresponds to your public facing Steam account ID.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"      Your public Steam account ID and display name will be shared with\n"
"    the service and other players when using Crossplay features in Barony.\n"
"      No third party account is required or created when using Crossplay.\n"
"\n"
"    Click \"View Privacy Policy\" below to see how Barony handles your data."

