#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:194"
msgid "Season's Greetings!"
msgstr "¡Saludos navideños!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:195"
msgid ""
"Ho ho ho!\n"
"Merry Christmas!"
msgstr ""
"¡Jo, jo, jo!\n"
"¡Feliz Navidad!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:196"
msgid "Happy Holidays!"
msgstr "¡Felices fiestas!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:197"
msgid ""
"Have you been naughty\n"
"this year?"
msgstr ""
"¿Te has portado mal\n"
"este año?"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:198"
msgid ""
"Better than a stocking\n"
"full of coal!"
msgstr ""
"¡Mejor que un calcetín\n"
"lleno de carbón!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:199"
msgid ""
"Remember to send\n"
"a \"Thank You\" note!"
msgstr ""
"¡Recuerda enviar\n"
"una nota de agradecimiento!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:200"
msgid ""
"It is better to give\n"
"than receive."
msgstr ""
"Es mejor dar\n"
"que recibir."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:201"
msgid ""
"That item made me\n"
" think of you."
msgstr ""
"Ese objeto me hizo\n"
" pensar en ti."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:202"
msgid "A fine gift exchange!"
msgstr "¡Un gran intercambio de regalos!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:203"
msgid "Ho ho ho! No no no."
msgstr "¡Jo, jo, jo! No, no, no."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:204"
msgid ""
"You don't want to be\n"
"on my naughty list!"
msgstr ""
"¡No querrás estar en\n"
"mi lista de mala conducta!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:205"
msgid ""
"You need a stocking\n"
"full of gold!"
msgstr ""
"¡Necesitas un calcetín\n"
"lleno de oro!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:206"
msgid "A generous gift!"
msgstr "¡Un regalo generoso!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:207"
msgid "You shouldn't have!"
msgstr "¡No hacía falta!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:208"
msgid "You're too kind!"
msgstr "¡Qué amabilidad!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:209"
msgid ""
"I know a good boy\n"
"who wants this."
msgstr ""
"Conozco a un niño bueno\n"
"que quiere esto."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:210"
msgid ""
"I know a good girl\n"
"who wants this."
msgstr ""
"Conozco a una niña buena\n"
"que quiere esto."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:211"
msgid ""
"Kids are always\n"
"asking for those."
msgstr ""
"Los niños siempre\n"
"piden regalos así."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:212"
msgid "'Tis not the season for that."
msgstr "No es época para eso."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:213"
msgid "I'd rather some figgy pudding."
msgstr "Preferiría pudín de higos."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:214"
msgid "That's not on my list, sorry."
msgstr "No está en mi lista, lo siento."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:216"
msgid ""
"At Christmas, all\n"
"roads lead home."
msgstr ""
"En Navidad, todos\n"
"los caminos llevan a casa."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:217"
msgid ""
"Christmas will always be\n"
"as long as we stand heart\n"
"to heart and hand-in-hand."
msgstr ""
"Siempre habrá Navidad\n"
"si unimos nuestros corazones\n"
"y nos tomamos de la mano."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:218"
msgid ""
"A joy shared is a joy\n"
"made double."
msgstr ""
"La alegría compartida\n"
"vale por dos."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:219"
msgid ""
"Remembrance, like a\n"
"candle, burns brightest\n"
"at Christmastime."
msgstr ""
"El recuerdo, como una\n"
"vela, brilla con más fuerza\n"
"en Navidad."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:220"
msgid ""
"Christmas is doing a\n"
"little extra for someone."
msgstr ""
"Navidad es hacer\n"
"un poco más por alguien."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:221"
msgid ""
"Christmas is the season\n"
"for kindling the fire of\n"
"hospitality."
msgstr ""
"La Navidad es tiempo\n"
"de avivar el fuego de\n"
"la hospitalidad."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:222"
msgid ""
"May your days be\n"
"merry and bright!"
msgstr ""
"¡Que tus días sean\n"
"felices y luminosos!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:223"
msgid ""
"'Tis the season\n"
"of giving!"
msgstr ""
"¡Es tiempo\n"
"de regalar!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:224"
msgid ""
"Christmas waves a magic\n"
"wand over this world,\n"
"and behold, everything is\n"
"softer and more beautiful."
msgstr ""
"La Navidad agita su varita\n"
"mágica sobre el mundo,\n"
"y todo se vuelve\n"
"más amable y hermoso."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:225"
msgid ""
"It's not how much we\n"
"give, but how much love\n"
"we put into giving."
msgstr ""
"No importa cuánto damos,\n"
"sino cuánto amor\n"
"ponemos al dar."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:226"
msgid ""
"It's the most\n"
"wonderful time\n"
"of the year!"
msgstr ""
"¡Es la época\n"
"más maravillosa\n"
"del año!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:227"
msgid ""
"Christmas isn't just a\n"
"day, it's a frame of mind."
msgstr ""
"La Navidad no es solo un día,\n"
"es un estado de ánimo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:228"
msgid ""
"Christmas is a season\n"
"not only of rejoicing,\n"
"but of reflection."
msgstr ""
"La Navidad es tiempo\n"
"no solo de alegría,\n"
"sino de reflexión."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:229"
msgid ""
"The world has grown\n"
"weary through the years,\n"
"but at Christmas\n"
"it is young."
msgstr ""
"Los años han dejado\n"
"al mundo exhausto,\n"
"pero en Navidad\n"
"rejuvenece."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:230"
msgid ""
"He who has not Christmas\n"
"in his heart will never\n"
"find it under a tree."
msgstr ""
"Quien no lleva la Navidad\n"
"en el corazón nunca\n"
"la hallará bajo un árbol."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:231"
msgid ""
"The joy of brightening\n"
"other lives becomes for\n"
"us the magic of the\n"
"holidays."
msgstr ""
"La alegría de iluminar\n"
"otras vidas se convierte\n"
"para nosotros en la magia\n"
"de las fiestas."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:232"
msgid ""
"I should write a philosophy\n"
"of toys, showing that\n"
"nothing else in life need\n"
"to be taken seriously."
msgstr ""
"Debería escribir una filosofía\n"
"de los juguetes, mostrando\n"
"que nada más en la vida\n"
"necesita tomarse en serio."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:233"
msgid ""
"Perhaps the best Yuletide\n"
"decoration is being\n"
"wreathed in smiles."
msgstr ""
"Quizá el mejor adorno\n"
"navideño sea una\n"
"corona de sonrisas."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:234"
msgid "Baby it's cold outside."
msgstr "Cariño, hace frío afuera."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:235"
msgid "'Tis the season to be jolly!"
msgstr "¡Es tiempo de celebrar!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:255"
msgid "You see a decorated torch."
msgstr "Ves una antorcha decorada."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:262"
msgid "You see a decorated fountain."
msgstr "Ves una fuente decorada."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:266"
msgid "You see a gift box."
msgstr "Ves una caja de regalo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:267"
msgid "You see an decorated portcullis."
msgstr "Ves una reja levadiza decorada."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:270"
msgid "You see a giant snowball."
msgstr "Ves una bola de nieve gigante."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:271"
msgid "You see a Christmas tree."
msgstr "Ves un árbol de Navidad."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:373"
msgid "Gift Box Inventory"
msgstr "Inventario de la Caja de Regalo"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:374"
msgid "Took %s from the gift box."
msgstr "Sacaste %s de la caja de regalo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:400"
msgid "The spell locks the gift box!"
msgstr "¡El hechizo bloquea la caja de regalo!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:404"
msgid "The spell unlocks the gift box!"
msgstr "¡El hechizo desbloquea la caja de regalo!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:405"
msgid "Your spell destroys the giant snowball!"
msgstr "¡Tu hechizo destruye la bola de nieve gigante!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:455"
msgid "You are struck by a giant snowball!"
msgstr "¡Una bola de nieve gigante te golpea!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:456"
msgid "You lack the might to move the giant snowball."
msgstr "Te falta fuerza para mover la bola de nieve gigante."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:459"
msgid "The gift box swings open!"
msgstr "¡La caja de regalo se abre de golpe!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:460"
msgid "You seal the gift box shut!"
msgstr "¡Cierras y sellas la caja de regalo!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:461"
msgid "Somebody closed the gift box!"
msgstr "¡Alguien cerró la caja de regalo!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:462"
msgid "The gift box is locked!"
msgstr "¡La caja de regalo está bloqueada!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:463"
msgid "You put the %s into the gift box."
msgstr "Guardas %s en la caja de regalo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:485"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"I believe... I believe...\n"
"  it's silly, but I believe.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Creo... creo...\n"
"  es una tontería, pero creo.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:486"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"A good conscience is a\n"
"  continual Christmas.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Una conciencia tranquila\n"
"  es una Navidad perpetua.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:487"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"Gifts of time and love are\n"
"  surely the the basic ingredients\n"
"  of a truly merry Christmas\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Regalar tiempo y amor\n"
"  es la base de una Navidad\n"
"  verdaderamente feliz.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:488"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"A Christmas miracle is when\n"
"  your family doesn't get into\n"
"  a single argument all day.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Un milagro navideño es que\n"
"  tu familia pase todo el día\n"
"  sin una sola discusión.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:489"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"What if Christmas didn't\n"
"  come from a store. What if\n"
"  it means a little bit more?\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"¿Y si la Navidad no viniera\n"
"  de una tienda? ¿Y si\n"
"  significara algo más?\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:490"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"At Christmas, you\n"
"  tell the truth\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"En Navidad,\n"
"  dices la verdad.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:491"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"No man is a failure\n"
"  who has friends.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Nadie que tenga amigos\n"
"  es un fracaso.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:492"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"No one should be alone\n"
"  on Christmas.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Nadie debería pasar\n"
"  la Navidad en soledad.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:493"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"Christmas is compulsory, like\n"
"  a thunderstorm, and we all\n"
"  go through it together.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"La Navidad es obligatoria,\n"
"  como una tormenta, y todos\n"
"  la atravesamos juntos.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:494"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"There has to be at least one\n"
"  day of the year to remind us\n"
"  that we're here for something\n"
"  else besides ourselves.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Debe haber al menos un\n"
"  día al año que nos recuerde\n"
"  que estamos aquí por algo\n"
"  más que por nosotros mismos.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:495"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"Reflect upon your present\n"
"  blessings -- of which every man\n"
"  has many -- not on your past\n"
"  misfortunes, of which all\n"
"  men have some.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Piensa en las bendiciones\n"
"  del presente, que son muchas,\n"
"  y no en las desgracias\n"
"  del pasado, que todos tenemos.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:496"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"Thumpity thump thump,\n"
"  thumpity thump thump,\n"
"  look at Frosty go!\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Pum, patapum, pum,\n"
"  pum, patapum, pum,\n"
"  ¡mira cómo va Frosty!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:497"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"Mistletoe. It's often\n"
"  infested with nargles.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Muérdago. Suele estar\n"
"  infestado de nargles.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:498"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"The main reason Santa is so\n"
"  jolly is because he knows where\n"
"  all the bad girls live.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Papá Noel está tan alegre\n"
"  porque sabe dónde viven\n"
"  todas las chicas malas.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:499"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"It's lovely weather\n"
"  for a sleigh ride\n"
"  together with you.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Qué lindo clima\n"
"  para un paseo en trineo\n"
"  contigo.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:500"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"Sweet silver bells,\n"
"  all seem to say,\n"
"  ding-dong, m'kay.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Dulces campanas de plata,\n"
"  todas parecen decir:\n"
"  din-don, ¿ok?\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:501"
msgid ""
"There's a card in the tree:\n"
"  \"He loves me, I love you.\n"
"  Therefore, vicariously,\n"
"  he loves you.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una tarjeta en el árbol:\n"
"  \"Él me ama, yo te amo.\n"
"  Por lo tanto, por extensión,\n"
"  él te ama.\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:502"
msgid "A snowman emerges from the tree!"
msgstr "¡Un muñeco de nieve emerge del árbol!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:540"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Santa's helpers pay nothing for unidentified gems.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Los ayudantes de Papá Noel no pagan por gemas sin identificar.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:563"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Elfs and trolls are best friends.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Los duendes y los troles son mejores amigos.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:564"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Santa really IS a magical genius!\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"¡Papá Noel SÍ que es un genio de la magia!\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:568"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Broken gift boxes don't yield many items.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Las cajas de regalo rotas sueltan pocos objetos.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:663"
msgid "You destroy the giant snowball!"
msgstr "¡Destruyes la bola de nieve gigante!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:667"
msgid "You hit the gift box!"
msgstr "¡Golpeas la caja de regalo!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:671"
msgid "The gift box is smashed into pieces!"
msgstr "¡La caja de regalo queda hecha pedazos!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:675"
msgid "gift box"
msgstr "caja de regalo"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:716"
msgid "You hear the faint crunch of giant snowballs."
msgstr "Oyes el tenue crujido de bolas de nieve gigantes."

