msgid "You lock the gift box."
msgstr "Bloqueas la caja de regalo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:1102"
msgid "You failed to unlock the gift box."
msgstr "No lograste desbloquear la caja de regalo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:1105"
msgid "This gift box is already unlocked."
msgstr "Esta caja de regalo ya está desbloqueada."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:1505"
msgid "fails to dodge the incoming giant snowball."
msgstr "no logra esquivar la bola de nieve gigante."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:1521"
msgid "gets scratched off the naughty list by an elf."
msgstr "un duende borra su nombre de la lista de mala conducta."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:1527"
msgid "gets added to Santa's naughty list."
msgstr "acaba en la lista de mala conducta de Papá Noel."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:1969"
msgid "Grab All From Gift Box"
msgstr "Tomar Todo de la Caja de Regalo"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:2366"
msgid "The pedestal seems to require some sort of holiday element."
msgstr "El pedestal parece requerir algún elemento navideño."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:2367"
msgid "The element defies your grasp and is unable to be retrieved!"
msgstr "¡El elemento se resiste a tu agarre y no puedes recuperarlo!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:2368"
msgid "You place the holiday element in the receptacle..."
msgstr "Colocas el elemento navideño en el receptáculo..."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:2370"
msgid "The holiday element starts floating!"
msgstr "¡El elemento navideño empieza a flotar!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:2377"
msgid "You see a holiday element sitting atop a pedestal."
msgstr "Ves un elemento navideño sobre un pedestal."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:2520"
msgid "Your spell destroys the gift box!"
msgstr "¡Tu hechizo destruye la caja de regalo!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:2712"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" Santa's Helpers are tougher after surviving the Baron's dungeon."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Los ayudantes de Papá Noel son más fuertes\n"
" tras sobrevivir a la mazmorra del Barón."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:2821"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I sensed power from the ornament when you put it on that pedestal."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Sentí el poder del adorno cuando lo pusiste en ese pedestal."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:2823"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" I was able to trap some of the power that Herx's ornament released."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Logré atrapar parte del poder que liberó el adorno de Herx."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:2824"
msgid ""
"The %s\n"
" This portal pierces the seal to the Caves using the power of the ornament."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Este portal atraviesa el sello de las Cuevas con el poder del adorno."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:2834"
msgid ""
"%s\n"
" I'm only interested in the rarest of\n"
" artifacts in the land.              \n"
" In particular, the holiday elements that were stolen by Herx."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Solo me interesan los artefactos más\n"
" raros de estas tierras.\n"
" En particular, los elementos navideños que robó Herx."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:2836"
msgid ""
"%s\n"
" You see, a high ranking guild member\n"
" such as myself can extort those mages \n"
" for every penny they own with their \n"
" precious holiday elements!"
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
" Verás, por mi alto rango en el gremio\n"
" puedo extorsionar a esos magos\n"
" hasta sacarles su última moneda\n"
" gracias a sus preciados elementos navideños."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:3088"
msgid "That one was from last year!"
msgstr "¡Eso era del año pasado!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:3099"
msgid "gift box"
msgstr "caja de regalo"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:3243"
msgid "You're on my naughty list, %s %s!"
msgstr "¡Estás en mi lista de mala conducta, %s %s!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:3244"
msgid "discovers all %s are on %s's naughty list."
msgstr "descubre que todos los %s están en la lista de mala conducta de %s."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:3317"
msgid "Locks doors and gift boxes"
msgstr "Bloquea puertas y cajas de regalo"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:3897"
msgid "You spot a hidden compartment inside the gift box!"
msgstr "¡Descubres un compartimento oculto en la caja de regalo!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:3974"
msgid "The giant snowball cannot be moved that way."
msgstr "La bola de nieve gigante no se puede mover así."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:4004"
msgid "Close gift box"
msgstr "Cerrar caja de regalo"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:4005"
msgid "Open gift box"
msgstr "Abrir caja de regalo"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:4010"
msgid "Inspect Christmas tree"
msgstr "Inspeccionar árbol de Navidad"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:4021"
msgid "Push snowball"
msgstr "Empujar bola de nieve"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:4022"
msgid "Take holiday element"
msgstr "Tomar elemento navideño"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:4088"
msgid "You found %d gold pieces in the gift box!"
msgstr "¡Hallaste %d monedas de oro en la caja de regalo!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:4098"
msgid ""
"There is no room left in the gift box for a\n"
" %s!"
msgstr ""
"¡No queda espacio en la caja de regalo para\n"
" %s!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:4099"
msgid "Took %d items from the gift box."
msgstr "Sacaste %d objetos de la caja de regalo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:4126"
msgid ""
"Hand the element to me directly.\n"
"There is no need to involve\n"
"formalities of gold, now!"
msgstr ""
"Entrégame el elemento directamente.\n"
"¡Ahora no hace falta\n"
"andar con pagos en oro!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/merry/lang/en.txt:4197"
msgid "You put %d %s into the gift box."
msgstr "Guardas %d %s en la caja de regalo."

