#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:217"
msgid ""
"Most people are so\n"
"ungrateful to be alive.\n"
"But not you. \n"
"Not anymore."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría no agradece\n"
"el simple hecho de vivir.\n"
"Pero tú sí.\n"
"Ahora sí."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:221"
msgid ""
"The creature ignores thee if\n"
"thou keepest thy distance!"
msgstr ""
"¡La criatura te ignora\n"
"si mantienes la distancia!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:224"
msgid "Do you like scary movies?"
msgstr "¿Te gustan las películas de terror?"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:227"
msgid ""
"I'm the ghost with the most,\n"
"babe. Go ahead. Make my\n"
"millennium!"
msgstr ""
"Soy el fantasma más genial,\n"
"cariño. Adelante. ¡Alégrame\n"
"el milenio!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:228"
msgid ""
"Sacks of candy may have\n"
"melted sugar pooled up inside.\n"
"Use a towel to clean thyself."
msgstr ""
"Las bolsas de dulces pueden\n"
"acumular azúcar derretida.\n"
"Usa una toalla para limpiarte."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:230"
msgid ""
"The rats are generous! They\n"
"offer full size candy bars."
msgstr ""
"¡Las ratas son generosas! Dan\n"
"barras de chocolate enteras."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:233"
msgid ""
"I'd avoid stale candy if I\n"
"were you. It can be too much\n"
"for weak tummies."
msgstr ""
"Yo evitaría los dulces viejos.\n"
"Pueden ser demasiado para\n"
"los estómagos delicados."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:255"
msgid "You see a trapped flaming spirit."
msgstr "Ves un espíritu ardiente atrapado."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:260"
msgid "You see a spirit pit."
msgstr "Ves un foso de espíritus."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:270"
msgid "You see a gigantic, award-winning pumpkin."
msgstr "Ves una calabaza gigante premiada."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:274"
msgid "You see a table built for torture."
msgstr "Ves una mesa de tortura."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:405"
msgid "Your spell destroys the gigantic pumpkin!"
msgstr "¡Tu hechizo destruye la calabaza gigante!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:455"
msgid "You are struck by a huge pumpkin!"
msgstr "¡Una enorme calabaza te golpea!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:456"
msgid "You lack the might to move the pumpkin."
msgstr "Te falta fuerza para mover la calabaza."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:457"
msgid "You coax a lost spirit from the pit."
msgstr "Convences a un espíritu perdido de salir del foso."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:458"
msgid "The spirit flames have diminished."
msgstr "Las llamas espirituales han disminuido."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:467"
msgid "The cauldron is stagnant."
msgstr "El caldero está estancado."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:473"
msgid "The cauldron blesses your equipment."
msgstr "El caldero bendice tu equipo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:474"
msgid "There's no more use for the cauldron."
msgstr "El caldero ya no sirve."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:477"
msgid "The torture table is sticky with blood."
msgstr "La sangre deja pegajosa la mesa de tortura."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:485"
msgid "Here's Johnny!!"
msgstr "¡¡Aquí está Johnny!!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:486"
msgid ""
"There'll be food and drink\n"
"  and ghosts ... perhaps even a\n"
"  few murders. You're all invited."
msgstr ""
"Habrá comida, bebida\n"
"  y fantasmas... quizá también\n"
"  algún asesinato. ¡Vengan!"

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:487"
msgid ""
"Here lies the body of Blake\n"
"  Hit the gas instead of the brake\""
msgstr ""
"Aquí yace el cuerpo de Blake\n"
"  Aceleró en vez de frenar."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:488"
msgid ""
"Here lies Vlad. He\n"
"  never drank ... wine."
msgstr ""
"Aquí yace Vlad.\n"
"  Nunca bebía... vino."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:489"
msgid ""
"A boy's best friend\n"
"  is his mother."
msgstr ""
"La mejor amiga de un niño\n"
"  es su madre."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:490"
msgid "R.I.P."
msgstr "D. E. P."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:491"
msgid ""
"We all go a little\n"
"  mad sometimes."
msgstr ""
"A veces a cualquiera\n"
"  se le va la cabeza."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:492"
msgid ""
"To die -- to be really dead\n"
"  that must be glorious."
msgstr ""
"Morir... morir de verdad...\n"
"  debe de ser glorioso."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:493"
msgid ""
"You're doing to\n"
"  die up there.\""
msgstr ""
"Vas a morir\n"
"  allá arriba."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:494"
msgid ""
"Your mother's in here. Would\n"
"  you like to leave a message?\n"
"  I'll see that she gets it."
msgstr ""
"Tu madre está aquí. ¿Quieres\n"
"  dejarle un mensaje?\n"
"  Me aseguraré de que lo reciba."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:495"
msgid "Sin never dies."
msgstr "El pecado nunca muere."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:496"
msgid ""
"Here lies Ingrid\n"
"  Spooked by a scary skeleton"
msgstr ""
"Aquí yace Ingrid\n"
"  Un esqueleto le dio un susto mortal."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:497"
msgid ""
"When there's no more room\n"
"  in hell, the dead will roam\n"
"  the earth."
msgstr ""
"Cuando no quede sitio\n"
"  en el infierno, los muertos\n"
"  caminarán por la tierra."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:498"
msgid ""
"All work and no play\n"
"  makes Jack a dull boy."
msgstr ""
"Tanto trabajo y nada de juego\n"
"  hacen de Jack un chico aburrido."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:499"
msgid ""
"Come and play with us.\n"
"  Forever ...  and ever ...\n"
"  and ever."
msgstr ""
"Ven a jugar con nosotros.\n"
"  Por siempre... y siempre...\n"
"  y siempre."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:500"
msgid ""
"Be afraid. Be\n"
"  very afraid."
msgstr ""
"Ten miedo.\n"
"  Mucho miedo."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:501"
msgid "Sometimes dead is better."
msgstr "A veces es mejor morir."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:538"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"I ate his liver with some fava beans and a nice chianti.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Comí su hígado con habas y un buen chianti.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:539"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"I'm your number one fan.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Soy tu fan número uno.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:540"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"What is innocent blood if not for shedding?\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"¿Para qué sirve la sangre inocente si no es para derramarla?\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:541"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"I see dead people.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Veo gente muerta.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:542"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"I know what you did last summer.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Sé lo que hiciste el verano pasado.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:543"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"You can't kill the boogeyman.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"No puedes matar al coco.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:544"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"I guess everyone's entitled to one good scare.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Todos tienen derecho a un buen susto.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:545"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Evil is real.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"El mal es real.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:546"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"You should never say 'I'll be right back'.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Nunca debes decir 'ahora vuelvo'.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:547"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"We'll tear your soul apart.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Te haremos el alma pedazos.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:548"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Angels to some, demons to others.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Ángeles para unos, demonios para otros.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:549"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Save your breath for screaming.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Guarda el aliento para gritar.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:550"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Whatever you do, don't fall asleep.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Hagas lo que hagas, no te duermas.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:551"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"I'm into murders and executions, mostly.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Lo mío son los asesinatos y las ejecuciones, sobre todo.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:552"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"My family's always been in meat.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Mi familia siempre se ha dedicado a la carne.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:553"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"You're a regular barynard exhibit.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Eres todo un espectáculo de corral.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:554"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Psychos do not explode when sunlight hits them.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Los psicópatas no explotan al recibir la luz del sol.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:555"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"I'm sure it's a lot scarier at night.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Seguro que da mucho más miedo de noche.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:556"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"You've got red on you.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Tienes algo rojo encima.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:557"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Do not read the latin.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"No leas el latín.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:558"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"So we just gonna ignore the bear then?\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"¿Entonces vamos a ignorar al oso?\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:559"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Have you checked the children lately?\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"¿Has ido a ver cómo están los niños?\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:560"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Hell is only a word. The reality is much worse.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"El infierno es solo una palabra. La realidad es mucho peor.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:561"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"I got this feeling ... a weird feeling.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Tengo una sensación... una sensación extraña.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:562"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Seven days.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Siete días.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:563"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"They just don't believe like they used to.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Ya no creen como antes.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:564"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"It's not the house that's haunted.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"La casa no es la que está embrujada.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:565"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"We all float down here.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Todos flotamos aquí abajo.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:566"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"I never wanted to be your mother.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Nunca quise ser tu madre.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:567"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"Do I look like some kind of monster?\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"¿Acaso parezco un monstruo?\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:568"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"This thing needs trauma to spread.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Esta cosa necesita traumas para propagarse.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:569"
msgid ""
"\"Did you know?\"\n"
"\"They mostly come out at night. Mostly.\"\n"
"\"It's true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que...?\"\n"
"\"Salen sobre todo de noche. Sobre todo.\"\n"
"\"¡Es verdad!\""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "themes/scarony/lang/en.txt:589"
msgid "You take the spirit flame from the wall."
msgstr "Tomas la llama espiritual de la pared."

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
